    {
      "sop": "conclusion",
      "heading": "Conclusion and Outlook for the Wealth Management Platform Market",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The wealth management platform market has grown at a steady pace and is set to more than double by the end of the forecast period. Hybrid advice and cloud delivery now shape how firms reach clients, North America holds the largest share and Asia Pacific grows fastest. Competitors of every size are arming themselves with AI, and that pressure keeps features and prices moving. Growing adoption of robo advisory solutions presents a huge opportunity in the global wealth management platform market, and continued advances in big data analytics and AI open further room for providers. The outlook for the wealth management platform market therefore favours firms that pair automation with human advice. A CMI analyst expects the winners to be the vendors that make AI a working part of daily advice rather than a showcase feature."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
