- Wrise acquired a 20% minority stake in Thai wealth platform IFCG, which will continue to lead wealth advisory and distribution activities in Thailand. (source: Citywire, 2026-10)
- Chubb Wealth partnered with Hamilton Lane to offer private evergreen funds through its wealth management platform, including funds focused on Asia private assets, private infrastructure and venture and growth opportunities. (source: Citywire, 2026-10)
